{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/10/28/6325359/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぎゃおお！オバケだぞー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/10/28/6325359/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぎゅあぁぁぁああああ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手術してやるぅぅぅううーー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/10/28/6325359/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐへへぐへへへへへ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ところでこの一連の流れととんでもなく関係ない話題をぶっ込むけど、今日は初めてアンチョビってやつを食べました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友「アンチョビ食べれる？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私「ボンジョビってなに...？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友「アンチョビだよ。」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私「 ああ( 　・　＿　・ 　) 」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆには無理かも...とか言われると余計食べたくなるのが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"( 　・　＿　・ 　)☜こいつの性格。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わくわくわくわく！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガブッ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ლ(◉◞౪◟◉ )ლぶゃっはーーーーー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人の味ってやつだった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/10/28/6325359/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハハハ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"燃え尽きたぜ！真っ白にな！！！！！！！ハハハ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よって私はいま、アイスクリームを食べている。結局コレなんだなーあー美味しいっす(｀；ω；´)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕張メッセで開催された、VAMPSさん主宰「HALLOWEEN PARTY 2013」に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"25日につづいて、最終日の昨日も参加させて頂きました（ミ＾o＾ミ）☆ミ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハロウィンに因んだスペシャルバージョンで、17人のうちの1人としてパフォーマンスできたこと、本当に有難く思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな衣装を着たよっ ＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/10/28/6325359/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガオガオっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんと( ﹡ˆoˆ﹡ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/10/28/6325359/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで秋なんて、紅葉きれいだなー。とか、かぼちゃ美味いなー。(´◡`๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くらいでなんとなーく過ぎてゆくものだったので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなハロウィンメイクとか、初めてで。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つまりこれが人生で初めて経験するハロウィンってやつ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな楽しいものなのだな！┗(^o^ )┓<33 知らなかった...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても素晴らしいステージに２日間も立たせて頂き、夢のようでした。。(*´pq｀)いや本当にハロウィンの幻だったのではないかと...思うくらいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"呼んでくださったVAMPSさんに心から感謝です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出演者のみなさんも、優しくして下さって本当に有難う御座いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてなにより、お越し下さったみなさん、素敵な時間を有難う御座いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までの人生の秋で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番楽しかったです！ヽ(^ω^)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またこんな楽しいハロウィンが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"過ごせたらいいな... ＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/10/28/6325359/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問にこたえるよ（ミ＾o＾ミ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎  東京オリンピックが開催される2020年、さゆにゃんはどんな大人の女性になっていたい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊  小さい頃、大人になるってことは、他人の支えなしに、自分のことが自分で出来るようになることだと思ってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、大人になるにつれわかったことは、逆に自分のことしか出来なくなってるってこと。そういう大人も多いこと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと周りを大切にして、色んなことに感謝して...そういう大人になってたいな...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから余計に、小さい頃から憧れてる戦隊ヒーローみたく、誰かのために闘う気持ちを忘れたくないのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義！"}],"source":"archive"}